<section id="about" class="py-24 md:py-32 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">

    <div class="reveal-fade-right">
      <div class="mb-8 relative w-32 h-32 mx-auto lg:mx-0">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-accent-blue/20 blur-xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <img
          src="/images/profile.jpeg"
          alt="Qazi Sultan — Digital Marketing Specialist"
          class="relative w-32 h-32 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-accent-blue/40"
          width="128"
          height="128"
        />
      </div>

      <p class="text-accent-blue text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 text-center lg:text-left">About Me</p>
      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-text-primary leading-tight mb-6 text-center lg:text-left">
        CS Student.<br />
        <span class="text-accent-blue">Certified Marketer.</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-text-muted text-base leading-relaxed text-center lg:text-left">
        <p>
          I'm a Meta &amp; Google certified digital marketer completing my BSc in Computer Science at GCU Lahore (2026).
        </p>
        <p>
          That combination is rare — I bring both the technical foundation and the marketing execution that most professionals only have one of.
        </p>
        <p>
          I've managed live paid campaigns for real clients, achieving results that exceed industry benchmarks — not by luck, but by research, testing, and data-driven optimization.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 reveal-fade-left">
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 text-center glow-hover">
        <p class="font-heading font-bold text-4xl text-accent-blue" data-target="2">0</p>
        <p class="stat-label mt-2">Global Certifications</p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 text-center glow-hover">
        <p class="font-heading font-bold text-4xl text-accent-blue" data-target="1">0</p>
        <p class="stat-label mt-2">Live Paid Campaign</p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 text-center glow-hover">
        <p class="font-heading font-bold text-4xl text-accent-gold" data-target="8.68" data-decimal="true">0</p>
        <p class="stat-label mt-2">CTR Achieved</p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 text-center glow-hover">
        <p class="font-heading font-bold text-4xl text-accent-gold">3×</p>
        <p class="stat-label mt-2">Industry Average</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>